From 57d0d46b6bb8ea3fc9f79d1ddc0868bb83f934b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 16:14:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix QR email inline image, scan timing/vibration,
 team-directory gating, add per-entry roster delete, mobile responsive fixes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- mailer.js: replace broken cid: inline image reference (unsupported by
  Brevo's transactional API) with a base64 data URI so the QR actually
  renders inline in the email instead of showing a broken image icon.
- index.html: fix scan-result timing — the 3s pause-before-resume was
  starting synchronously the instant a QR was detected, racing the async
  verifyToken() call, so it fired before the result even rendered. Now the
  countdown only starts once the result panel has actually painted. Also
  prime vibrate() permission on the camera-start button's direct user tap,
  since some Android browsers silently drop vibrate() calls not tied to a
  direct gesture.
- db.js: listAllUsers() (team directory) now only returns accounts that are
  actually usable — either admin-added with a password already set, or
  fully self-signed-up (OTP verified AND password chosen). Mid-flow signups
  and unclaimed admin placeholders no longer show in the Team list.
- server.js: add DELETE /api/students/:token for removing a single roster
  entry, protected by the same admin + secret-key check as the existing
  'clear this event's data' route.
- index.html: add a per-row Delete button on the Roster tab (admin-only,
  same confirm + secret-key flow as Clear Event Data); make Roster/Team/
  Members tables horizontally scrollable on narrow screens; fix .auth-box
  overflow on narrow phones; add a mobile media query for header stacking,
  scrollable tab bar, and tighter spacing.
